..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : BROWSER.ME
.. Autor          : fwester
.. Verantwortlich : cl
.. Kontrolle      : lei
.. Funktion       : Initialisiert den Maskenpuffer.
.. Functionality  : Initializes the buffer of mask.
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. Locale
.assign M|localerfc3066 = G|bspri
.continue LANGOK ? _F|empty(M|localerfc3066)
..
.. Fallback into alternative language or English
.type A74 xaltlang
.assign U|xaltlang = E|ESPR
.copy M|localerfc3066 = U|xaltlang ? _F|empty(U|xaltlang)
.assign M|localerfc3066 = "(en)"     ?  F|empty(M|localerfc3066)
..
!LANGOK
.assign M|locale = M|localerfc3066
..
.. Programs
.assign M|geturlprog = "is/BROWSER.GET.URL"
.assign M|seturlprog = "is/BROWSER.SET.URL"
..
.. URL elements
.input 'M|geturlprog'
..
.. URL
.input 'M|seturlprog'
..
.. .browser
.copy M|newwindow = G|FALSE
.copy M|browsefilesystem = G|FALSE
..
.. Others
.copy M|maxtreffer = 5
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
